VADER Sentiment Analysis
Original algorithm and lexicon: Copyright (c) 2014 C.J. Hutto and Eric Gilbert

This implementation is a faithful reproduction of the VADER algorithm as
described in:

Hutto, C.J. & Gilbert, E.E. (2014). VADER: A Parsimonious Rule-based Model
for Sentiment Analysis of Social Media Text. Eighth International Conference
on Weblogs and Social Media (ICWSM-14). Ann Arbor, MI, June 2014.

The VADER lexicon files (vader_lexicon.txt and emoji_utf8_lexicon.txt) are
distributed under the MIT License by the original authors and must be
downloaded separately from:
https://github.com/cjhutto/vaderSentiment
